cards.text:
{red|How has the emphasis on physical beauty affected you?}

{red|Do you tie your worth to your appearance? Do you compare constantly? Do you use physical presentation to gain attention or power?}

Be honest about your relationship with beauty and body image.

{red|How do you currently use your influence?}

{red|Do you build up or tear down? Create warmth or anxiety? Encourage or criticize?}

Be honest about both positive and negative patterns in how you influence others.

{red|How do you already bring life and growth to people and places?}

{red|Where might you be suppressing nurturing instincts because they seem 'less important' than other contributions?}

{red|How could you more fully embrace this part of your design?}

{red|How are you already expressing your femininity as a single woman?}

{red|What gifts are you deploying? What might you be holding back, thinking it's "for marriage"?}

{red|How can you live fully as a woman NOW, not just in preparation for a future role?}

{red|Where do you fall on the confidence spectrum?}

{red|Do you tend toward false humility, hiding your gifts? Or toward arrogance, needing to prove yourself?}

{red|What would godly confidence look like for you specifically?}
